      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Myoglobinuria is rare in association with pregnancy. We report a case of idiopathic myoglobinuria in the early puerperium in a patient who had a spontaneous vaginal delivery. Acute muscular pain and port wine staining of the urine should alert the clinician."},
